.problem
Multiple KL8's cut to a high baud rate (i.e. 8 KL8's
at 9600) interrupt at a high frequency rate. Interrupts
from other software modules are not being serviced as
frequently causing an unequal rate of data transfers.
.solution
Solution is in documentation under attention. After
initialization of module use Control-o to change loc's
to insert a preset counter which on reaching zero will
exit to the interrupt service; to service the other
software modules more frequently.
